OL,3,AThere's a crackdown on sports piracy -
OL,4,Abut is it already out of control?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere's a crackdown on sports piracy -
OL,7,Fbut is it already out of control?
OL,9,F"Football's Gone Round the Spend!"
OL,10,Fscreamed The People newspaper one
OL,11,FSunday in July 1995. It reported
OL,12,Fbreathlessly that three clubs between
OL,13,Fthem were set to pay out more than #20m
OL,14,Fon new players.
OL,16,FThe highlight that summer was the
OL,17,Ftransfer of Stan Collymore from
OL,18,FNottingham Forest to Liverpool for a
OL,19,FBritish record fee of #8.5m.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
