OL,3,AThere's a crackdown on sports piracy -
OL,4,Abut is it already out of control?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat number might not seem too
OL,7,Fimpressive today, in an age when #100m
OL,8,Ftransfers are almost commonplace. But
OL,9,Fat the time it was seismic stuff, and
OL,10,Fit symbolised the conversion of
OL,11,Ffootball from sport into big business.
